# Keep source releases small. Share assets remain available in the repository.
docs/share/ export-ignore

# Preserve third-party source byte-for-byte. Generated bundles may contain
# whitespace that is meaningful to embedded template literals.
# -text 禁止 EOL 转换:Windows 默认 autocrlf=true 的 git 检出会把 bash 脚本转成
# CRLF(comet-state.sh 立即死于 `set: pipefail\r`),且四个组件的目录级 SHA-256
# 全部对不上 manifest——完好的插件被 envcheck 误判"源码损坏"。
runtime/vendor/** -whitespace -text
runtime/bin/openspec -text
